# Bảo mật mọi trang (MỘT khối /* duy nhất – Cloudflare Pages chỉ giữ khối /* cuối nếu khai trùng đường dẫn → trước 17/10 HSTS, X-Frame-Options, Permissions-Policy, COOP không lên live).
# CSP đang ở chế độ Report-Only (chỉ báo lỗi trong DevTools, không chặn) – xem docs/AUDIT-2026-10.md trước khi đổi sang Content-Security-Policy thật.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(self), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://www.youtube.com https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; media-src 'self' data: blob: https://audio.lexkite.com https://media.lexkite.com https://lexkiteapp.github.io; connect-src 'self' https://lexkite.com https://*.googleapis.com https://www.gstatic.com https://audio.lexkite.com https://media.lexkite.com https://lexkiteapp.github.io https://api.datamuse.com https://api.mymemory.translated.net https://api.languagetool.org https://api.dictionaryapi.dev https://api.tatoeba.org https://en.wiktionary.org https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://huggingface.co https://*.huggingface.co https://*.hf.co https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src 'self' https://lexkite-app.firebaseapp.com https://accounts.google.com https://www.youtube-nocookie.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'

# Cloudflare Pages: mã nguồn luôn kiểm tra bản mới (ETag → 304 nếu không đổi, rất nhẹ); âm thanh/ảnh đặt tên theo nội dung → lưu lâu
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
# App học ở /app/ (trang / và /<lang>/ là trang giới thiệu tĩnh – HTML mặc định của Pages đã tự kiểm tra bản mới)
/app/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/app/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-store
/js/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/css/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/audio/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/screenshots/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/og-default.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
# Blog & trang SEO tĩnh: HTML luôn kiểm tra bản mới (bài đăng theo lịch); RSS/sitemap cũng vậy
/blog/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sitemap*.xml
  Cache-Control: no-cache
# Quản trị: gỡ header chung (! = detach) rồi đặt bản chặt hơn – tránh 2 dòng Referrer-Policy/Permissions-Policy
/admin*
  ! Referrer-Policy
  ! Permissions-Policy
  ! X-Frame-Options
  Cache-Control: no-store
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

/packs/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/i18n/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
